  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would it be possible to add a dev console screen that showed your camera coordinates in world. \n\nAs a content creator, sometimes I need to come back to a scene and get the same exact shot. (Layered videos with green screen/opacity masks) \n\nIt would be really nice to have a tool that would allow you to basically save your camera position data so you can return to it in the future. \n\nThe Pinned Cameras are great, but if you log off or change worlds that is gone. \n\nAlso, another request for a Camera Node system.",
